{"id":"2O","title":"Gratitude and Thanks","part":{"n":2,"title":"Relationship to God"},"url":"/law/02-relationship-to-god/2o","entries":[{"id":"2O.1","text":"We are required to give thanks to God.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":50,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":97,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":100,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":106,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":105,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":136,"verses":"1-4"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":4,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Psa. 50:14; Psa. 97:12; Psa. 100:4; Psa. 106:1; Psa. 105:1; Psa. 136:1-4; Col. 3:15; Col. 4:2."},{"id":"2O.2","text":"With thanksgiving let your requests be made known to God.","refs":[{"book":"Philippians","chapter":4,"verses":"6"}],"citation":"Phil. 4:6."},{"id":"2O.3","text":"It is a good thing to give thanks to God.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":92,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"Psa. 92:1."},{"id":"2O.4","text":"Offer thanks to Christ for guiding your life.","refs":[{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":1,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"1 Tim. 1:12."},{"id":"2O.5","text":"When we give thanks to God for what He has done in our lives, it demonstrates our faith in Him.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":17,"verses":"12-19"}],"citation":"Luke 17:12-19."},{"id":"2O.6","text":"Give thanks to God for His indescribable gift.","refs":[{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":9,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"2 Cor. 9:15."},{"id":"2O.7","text":"Give thanks through Christ and in His name.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":1,"verses":"8-9"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":7,"verses":"25"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":5,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Rom. 1:8-9; Rom. 7:25; Eph. 5:20; Col. 3:17; Heb. 13:15."},{"id":"2O.8","text":"Give thanks in public worship and addresses.","refs":[{"book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":16,"verses":"4,7-8"},{"book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":23,"verses":"30"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":31,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":35,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"1 Chron. 16:4, 7-8; 1 Chron. 23:30; 2 Chron. 31:2; Psa. 35:18."},{"id":"2O.9","text":"Give thanks always for all things to God.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":30,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":100,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":1,"verses":"16"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":5,"verses":"20"},{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":1,"verses":"2"},{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":5,"verses":"18"},{"book":"2 Thessalonians","chapter":1,"verses":"3"},{"book":"2 Thessalonians","chapter":2,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Psa. 30:12; Psa. 100:4; Eph. 1:16; Eph. 5:20; 1 Thes. 1:2; 1 Thes. 5:18; 2 Thes. 1:3; 2 Thes. 2:13."},{"id":"2O.10","text":"Give thanks upon the completion of great undertakings.","refs":[{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":12,"verses":"31,40"}],"citation":"Neh. 12:31, 40."},{"id":"2O.11","text":"Sing songs in thanks to God for all His goodness and the wonderful works He has done.","refs":[{"book":"1 Chronicles","chapter":16,"verses":"7,99"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":5,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Ezra","chapter":3,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":92,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":105,"verses":"1-2"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":107,"verses":"1,8"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":147,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"1 Chron. 16:7, 99 23; 2 Chron. 5:13; Ezra 3:11; Psa. 92:1; Psa. 105:1-2; Psa. 107:1, 8; 115:21, 31; Psa. 147:7."},{"id":"2O.12","text":"Give thanks before taking food.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":26,"verses":"27"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":14,"verses":"23"},{"book":"John","chapter":6,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":27,"verses":"35"}],"citation":"Matt. 26:27; Mark 14:23; John 6:11; Acts 27:35."},{"id":"2O.13","text":"Give thanks for victory over death and the grave.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":15,"verses":"57"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 15:57."},{"id":"2O.14","text":"Give thanks for wisdom and might.","refs":[{"book":"Daniel","chapter":2,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"Dan. 2:23."},{"id":"2O.15","text":"Give thanks for the grace and blessings bestowed on others.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":1,"verses":"3-5"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":1,"verses":"15-16"},{"book":"Philippians","chapter":1,"verses":"3-5"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":1,"verses":"3-6"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 1:3-5; Eph. 1:15-16; Phil. 1:3-5; Col. 1:3-6."},{"id":"2O.16","text":"Give thanks for supplying our bodily needs and other necessities.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":8,"verses":"10"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":14,"verses":"6-7"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":4,"verses":"3-4"}],"citation":"Deut 8:10; Rom. 14:6-7; 1 Tim. 4:3-4."},{"id":"2O.17","text":"Give thanks for nearness of God's presence.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":75,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"Psa. 75:1."}]}